<section class="relative py-20 border-y border-white/5 bg-space-950/40 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.015)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:20px_20px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/4 -translate-y-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-fuchsia-500/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center justify-between">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <h2 class="text-white text-balance tracking-tight leading-tight mb-2">
        Let's enjoy working
      </h2>
      <h2 class="bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-400 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight">
        together
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-6">
      <p class="text-lg text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
        In today's competitive landscape, every detail matters to consolidate your brand online. We specialize in amplifying the unique value of your business. Ready to make the digital leap? Let us guide you toward digital success with robust and elegant solutions.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-fuchsia-400 font-display">100%</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-white/50 mt-1">Commitment to delivery</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-400 font-display">24/7</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-white/50 mt-1">Support & reliability</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
